{"id":"6a2d66154fbf66e5","group":"58","path":"58/batch11/58-df-zfc-prob2-gaussian-measure.md","title":"ZFC Prob2 Gaussian Measure","display":"df-zfc-prob2-gaussian-measure — ZFC Prob2 Gaussian Measure","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-prob2-gaussian-measure","aliases":["58-df-zfc-prob2-gaussian-measure"],"display":"df-zfc-prob2-gaussian-measure — ZFC Prob2 Gaussian Measure","depends_on":["[[../batch01/58-df-zfc-measure9-gaussian-measure-schema]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-prob2-gaussian-measure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-prob2-gaussian-measure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-prob2-gaussian-measure — ZFC Prob2 Gaussian Measure"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"34a7e79edd9f7f6e\" href=\"?note=34a7e79edd9f7f6e\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-zfc-measure9-gaussian-measure-schema\">../batch01/58-df-zfc-measure9-gaussian-measure-schema</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gamma,E,\\tau,\\mathcal P,+_E,\\cdot_E,0_E,H,H^*\\in V\">\\(\\gamma,E,\\tau,\\mathcal P,+_E,\\cdot_E,0_E,H,H^*\\in V\\)</span> (measure, carrier, topology, locally convex structure data, its code, and continuous dual)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure9GaussianMeasureSchema}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure9GaussianMeasureSchema}_S\\)</span> (canonical Gaussian-measure predicate from the dependency)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcProb2GaussianMeasure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcProb2GaussianMeasure}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prob2\\text{-}gaussian\\text{-}measure}\\vdash{}\n\\mathrm{ZfcProb2GaussianMeasure}_S(\\gamma,E,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\mathcal P,+_E,\\cdot_E,0_E,H,H^*\\in V\\;\\Bigl(&amp;\nH=\\langle E,\\tau,\\mathcal P,\\mathbb R,+_E,\\cdot_E,0_E\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure9GaussianMeasureSchema}_S(\\gamma,H,H^*)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prob2\\text{-}gaussian\\text{-}measure}\\vdash{}\n\\mathrm{ZfcProb2GaussianMeasure}_S(\\gamma,E,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\mathcal P,+_E,\\cdot_E,0_E,H,H^*\\in V\\;\\Bigl(&amp;\nH=\\langle E,\\tau,\\mathcal P,\\mathbb R,+_E,\\cdot_E,0_E\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure9GaussianMeasureSchema}_S(\\gamma,H,H^*)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This predicate is the existential projection of the canonical locally-convex Gaussian-measure schema to its measure, carrier, and topology.  The schema supplies the continuous dual, Borel probability measure, pushforwards, and possibly degenerate one-dimensional Gaussian laws.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch01/58-df-zfc-measure9-gaussian-measure-schema","status":"resolved","id":"34a7e79edd9f7f6e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-zfc-measure9-gaussian-measure-schema]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\gamma,E,\\tau,\\mathcal P,+_E,\\cdot_E,0_E,H,H^*\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure9GaussianMeasureSchema}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcProb2GaussianMeasure}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prob2\\text{-}gaussian\\text{-}measure}\\vdash{}\n\\mathrm{ZfcProb2GaussianMeasure}_S(\\gamma,E,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\mathcal P,+_E,\\cdot_E,0_E,H,H^*\\in V\\;\\Bigl(&\nH=\\langle E,\\tau,\\mathcal P,\\mathbb R,+_E,\\cdot_E,0_E\\rangle\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure9GaussianMeasureSchema}_S(\\gamma,H,H^*)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1372,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3163","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-zfc-prob2-gaussian-measure.md|58-df-zfc-prob2-gaussian-measure]]（batch11）"}],"outgoing":["34a7e79edd9f7f6e"]}